\u00e4ltetechnik) spielerisch entdecken und erste berufstypische Aufgaben ausprobieren. Ob Technik, Gesundheit oder Handwerk \u2013 finde heraus, was dir am meisten Spa\u00df macht! :)\n\nEarly Access: Sei unter den Ersten, die jobVRiety testen!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "3902217326706597", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_3902217330039930_1240378813803928232_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BgSwD4XuG5AQ7kNvwGidODM&_nc_oc=AdrBwnm84b7PppQt_4x6ekUto6MFaIc0kyTztWPiW5-VQLqgm4KdmmNO77cloo0Fh1s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTtD-L-MRDUmIivp3RDXfYS7WdfxucbH7Offl_j_kEpxQ&oe=6B007D76"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_1080x360.png", "id": "3076099412552471", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825091_3076099415885804_5417180118801740963_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q7cQrwKGr0IQ7kNvwFLN_PI&_nc_oc=AdrTCXur6sVYmmmANyzqUmsTHxdP-K4NLElyPdUgxnBbwgkZwil5FJOM3LIF4OSMP9g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT0daZgM66QVJUcFMIQgzCIw_y72vXWLHVjjhYZcuZD6A&oe=6B007976"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare_1440x1440.png", "id": "2448391595528830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824609_2448391598862163_943533169723644988_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SVSYCZs-dFEQ7kNvwG8M_RW&_nc_oc=AdpE4FE1m3gzACH8NvfZ5tJyyM3kmKAHmFbUsewF_jhYFo_6IgBE2UZBoEZwIbudEKU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR1y-uRJa0eYdFa3u2Fn6eVY01ouF_efR9xWCWmU-Q5Dg&oe=6B007DFE"}, {"file_name": "JobVR_LogoClaim_rgb.png", "id": "1748084809102207", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "u